   "lines": [
    "Went to Wilcox's",
    "farm, at Huntly,",
    "60 miles from Chicago.",
    "In the afternoon Nell",
    "and I took a pre-",
    "liminary tramp",
    "through the great",
    "rolling fields after",
    "prarie chickens; we",
    "found a small flock",
    "late in the evening;",
    "he missed his bird,",
    "I killed mine. It is",
    "great fun to try",
    "the open plains",
    "shooting, to which I",
    "am entirely unaccus-",
    "-tomed — among",
    "such vast, almost",
    "level fields, with so",
    "few trees. The farm",
    "house fare is pretty rough."
   ],
   "rows": null,
   "columns": null,
